## Metric: 已入职员工人数

仅统计 `status` 为 1（已入职）的员工记录数，用于与待入职口径区分，支撑人员编制与流程报表。

### Scope

| Scope Type | Scope Ref |
|------------|-----------|
| object_type | employee |

### Calculation Formula

~~~yaml
version: 1
kind: atomic

atomic:
  condition:
    field: status
    operation: ==
    value: 1
  aggregation:
    property: id
    aggr: count
~~~

### Time Dimension

| Property | Default Range Policy |
|----------|----------------------|
| hire_date | calendar_day |

### Analysis Dimensions

| Name | Display Name |
|------|--------------|
| name | 姓名 |
